{"audit_run_id":"audit:ab32565a3bba40dd84cc85e400e3170a","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":80,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"`data.csv` holds the patient-level record for the stroke unit comparison of two"},{"end_column":80,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"thickened-liquid protocols. Seventy-two consecutive inpatients with post-stroke"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"swallowing difficulty were managed for fourteen days on one of the two protocols,"},{"end_column":83,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"thirty-six per protocol, and were assessed by the same speech and language therapy"},{"end_column":6,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"team."},{"end_column":84,"end_line":9,"start_column":1,"start_line":9,"text":"**One row is one patient.** The file has 72 data rows plus a header row. Every cell"},{"end_column":68,"end_line":10,"start_column":1,"start_line":10,"text":"is filled; there are no blanks and no repeated patient identifiers."},{"end_column":32,"end_line":14,"start_column":1,"start_line":14,"text":"| Column | Type | Description |"},{"end_column":20,"end_line":15,"start_column":1,"start_line":15,"text":"| --- | --- | --- |"},{"end_column":121,"end_line":16,"start_column":1,"start_line":16,"text":"| `patient_id` | text | Patient identifier, `PT01` through `PT72`, in admission order. One per patient, no duplicates. |"},{"end_column":160,"end_line":17,"start_column":1,"start_line":17,"text":"| `liquid_thickness` | text | The protocol the patient was managed on. Exactly two values: `mildly_thick` (36 patients) and `moderately_thick` (36 patients). |"},{"end_column":252,"end_line":18,"start_column":1,"start_line":18,"text":"| `penetration_aspiration_score` | integer | Declared outcome 1. Penetration-aspiration scale score at bedside swallow assessment. An ordered clinical score from 1 to 8, where a lower score means a safer swallow. Observed range in this file: 1 to 6. |"},{"end_column":132,"end_line":19,"start_column":1,"start_line":19,"text":"| `mealtime_duration_min` | number | Declared outcome 2. Time taken to complete a meal, in minutes. Observed range: 16.3 to 44.9. |"},{"end_column":143,"end_line":20,"start_column":1,"start_line":20,"text":"| `daily_oral_fluid_intake_ml` | integer | Declared outcome 3. Fluid taken by mouth over a day, in millilitres. Observed range: 735 to 1700. |"},{"end_column":171,"end_line":21,"start_column":1,"start_line":21,"text":"| `meal_completion_pct` | number | Declared outcome 4. Proportion of the served meal the patient completed, as a percentage from 0 to 100. Observed range: 46.2 to 96.2. |"},{"end_column":199,"end_line":22,"start_column":1,"start_line":22,"text":"| `weight_change_kg` | number | Declared outcome 5. Body weight change over the fourteen days, in kilograms. Negative means weight lost, positive means weight gained. Observed range: -3.0 to +1.3. |"},{"end_column":140,"end_line":23,"start_column":1,"start_line":23,"text":"| `coughing_episodes_per_meal` | integer | Declared outcome 6. Count of coughing episodes recorded during a meal. Observed range: 0 to 5. |"},{"end_column":82,"end_line":25,"start_column":1,"start_line":25,"text":"The six outcome columns appear in the order the protocol declared them, after the"},{"end_column":30,"end_line":26,"start_column":1,"start_line":26,"text":"identifier and group columns."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:c7942dfd2454bf21ee7c","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:1b6817587d00f3d4df5cc3dc3bb5dfb86ad631477118f414c4457652c3a75093","end_line":26,"locator":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md:1-26","path":"DATA_DESCRIPTION.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
{"audit_run_id":"audit:ab32565a3bba40dd84cc85e400e3170a","completed_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","coverage_status":"covered","emitted_record_refs":[],"extensions":{"x-candidate-spans":[{"end_column":92,"end_line":3,"start_column":1,"start_line":3,"text":"This study compares the two groups recorded in the `liquid_thickness` column of `data.csv`."},{"end_column":206,"end_line":4,"start_column":1,"start_line":4,"text":"The pre-declared outcome family, in this fixed order, is: penetration_aspiration_score, mealtime_duration_min, daily_oral_fluid_intake_ml, meal_completion_pct, weight_change_kg, coughing_episodes_per_meal."},{"end_column":85,"end_line":5,"start_column":1,"start_line":5,"text":"Each outcome is compared between the two groups. The named outcomes form one outcome"},{"end_column":88,"end_line":6,"start_column":1,"start_line":6,"text":"family; per-outcome comparisons over this family require complete-family control of the"},{"end_column":45,"end_line":7,"start_column":1,"start_line":7,"text":"family-wise error from multiple comparisons."}],"x-expected-count-method-declarations":[],"x-explicit-directional-claims":[],"x-explicit-expected-count-sensitivities":[],"x-explicit-quantitative-claims":[]},"opaque_constructs":[],"parser_disagreement":null,"parser_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","parser_result_id":"parser-result:4d058e5eea3d4ff98161","parser_version":"0.2.0","provenance":{"actor":{"actor_id":"parser:markdown-inventory","actor_kind":"parser"},"created_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","method":"static_inventory","tool":"sc-referee","tool_version":"0.3.0"},"record_type":"parser_result","schema_version":"0.21.0","source_ref":{"content_digest":"sha256:e159d0c8805db5be42ba19a34ad47f511788c2b554f0c603d8cd624384e85c32","end_line":7,"locator":"PROTOCOL.md:1-7","path":"PROTOCOL.md","source_kind":"file_span","start_line":1},"started_at":"2026-07-27T20:00:00Z","state":"parsed","syntax_issues":[]}
